&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Absolutely convinced of the importance of results and timelines&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Willing&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt; to travel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;frequently and work in a remote capacity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Excellent fit with Cannondale sales culture, which means entrepreneurial, dynamic, highly motivated individual with can-do mentality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Experience with B2B relationships and C&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;ommercial &amp;amp; Sales success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;Fluent in both French, German, and English (written &amp;amp; verbal)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
