&lt;p data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;node&quot; data-prosemirror-node-name=&quot;paragraph&quot; data-prosemirror-node-block=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-prosemirror-content-type=&quot;mark&quot; data-prosemirror-mark-name=&quot;strong&quot;&gt;Motivated Learner&lt;/strong&gt;: You learn new technologies and processes quickly, and understand where to look for knowledge when you need it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
