&lt;p class=&quot;font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal&quot;&gt;As&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Engineering Manager – Payment Experience&lt;/strong&gt;, you will lead two stream-aligned squads — Cards Experience and Cashier Experience — within the Transact tribe, working towards one vision: &quot;Right payment. Right method. Right moment.&quot; This is a full-stack leadership role spanning card PSP integrations and 3DS routing through to frontend performance and native release trains, sitting at the centre of customer trust and conversion, where speed, approval rates, and reliability matter as much as feature delivery. Cards Experience owns end-to-end card journeys representing close to half of global deposit volume, whilst Cashier Experience owns the Player Cashier platform that every payment squad builds on.&lt;/p&gt;
